{"Basware Oy": {"x": {"score": 94, "axis": "Product Strength", "composite_reported": 94, "evidence": [{"claim": "Basware SmartPDF AI platform automates data extraction from machine-readable PDFs into real e-invoices with a documented field-level accuracy rate exceeding 97%."}, {"claim": "Basware's AI-powered invoice capture engine guarantees up to 100% data capture accuracy across various document types, including paper, email, XML, and EDI formats."}, {"claim": "Basware Vendor Manager provides sequential review and approval steps configured by organization administrators with mandatory rejection comments and skippable routing rules."}, {"claim": "Basware AP Automation delivers intelligent exception routing and custom posting templates that automatically dictate how costs are dynamically allocated down to specific general ledger accounts."}, {"claim": "Basware API platform supports integration selections that synchronize transactional data directly with external multi-ERP landscapes and order matching modules."}, {"claim": "Basware AP Automation provides native cloud-compatible APIs that unify invoice ingestion workflows seamlessly across over 250 different ERP or source-to-pay networks globally."}, {"claim": "Basware SmartCoding relies on a proprietary machine-learning algorithm to analyze historical data trends and generate automated coding proposals for non-PO invoices."}, {"claim": "Basware InvoiceAI orchestrates advanced triple-matching layers and integrated duplication or validation rules across a massive dataset of 2.2 billion historical invoices."}, {"claim": "Basware platform accommodates large enterprise operations by scaling processing capacities to comfortably manage companies with over 50,000 annual invoice transactions."}, {"claim": "Basware Tax Compliance infrastructure features built-in global compliance modules automating localized tax regulations and e-invoicing laws natively across 50+ countries."}], "parameters": {"Invoice Capture & Data Extracti